msgid "Configuration, development and evidence tools"
msgstr "配置、开发与证据工具"

msgid ""
"Tools preserve actual process exits and input identities. A prepared plan is"
" not execution evidence; a model pass is not physical qualification. Run "
"maintained commands from the repository root with the selected tools on "
"`PATH`."
msgstr ""
"工具保留真实进程退出码与输入身份。准备计划不是执行证据；模型通过不是物理资格。从仓库根目录运行维护命令，并将所选工具放在 `PATH` 上。"

msgid ""
"Use the [fixed source checkout guide](../../guides/source-checkout.md) "
"before executing these tools; a default-branch clone may not contain the "
"documented entry."
msgstr ""
"执行这些工具前使用[固定源码取得指南](../../guides/source-checkout.md)；默认分支克隆可能没有文档中的入口。"

msgid "Entry"
msgstr "入口"

msgid "Task"
msgstr "任务"

msgid "Success does not establish"
msgstr "成功不建立以下结论"

msgid "`tools/dev/dev.py configure/build/test`"
msgstr "`tools/dev/dev.py configure/build/test`"

msgid "Explicit CMake/CTest preset path"
msgstr "显式 CMake／CTest 预设路径"

msgid "Other presets, skipped tests or HIL"
msgstr "其他预设、跳过测试或 HIL"

msgid "`tools/dev/dev.py doctor/check`"
msgstr "`tools/dev/dev.py doctor/check`"

msgid "Tool availability and repository checks"
msgstr "工具可用性与仓库检查"

msgid "A platform candidate"
msgstr "平台候选"

msgid "`tools/configure/configure.py`"
msgstr "`tools/configure/configure.py`"

msgid "init/list-bindings/check/explain/generate"
msgstr "init/list-bindings/check/explain/generate"

msgid "PCB electrical truth"
msgstr "PCB 电气事实"

msgid "`scripts/ci/tdd_gate.py`"
msgstr "`scripts/ci/tdd_gate.py`"

msgid "Actual full tool and GoogleTest/GoogleMock execution"
msgstr "实际完整工具与 GoogleTest／GoogleMock 执行"

msgid "Historical RED order or HIL"
msgstr "历史 RED 顺序或 HIL"

msgid "`cmake/package/package_source_sdk.py`"
msgstr "`cmake/package/package_source_sdk.py`"

msgid "Package or verify exact source bytes"
msgstr "打包或验证精确源码字节"

msgid "MCU execution or release promotion"
msgstr "MCU 执行或发行升级"

msgid "`cmake/package/verify_consumers.py`"
msgstr "`cmake/package/verify_consumers.py`"

msgid "Relocated public consumer compile/run/link"
msgstr "搬移后公共消费工程编译／运行／链接"

msgid "Hardware timing"
msgstr "硬件时序"

msgid "`tools/measurement/`"
msgstr "`tools/measurement/`"

msgid "Actual ELF resource, layout and retention checks"
msgstr "实际 ELF 资源、布局与保留检查"

msgid "Measured stack peaks or WCET"
msgstr "实测栈峰值或 WCET"

msgid "`tools/hil/`"
msgstr "`tools/hil/`"

msgid ""
"Preparation, admission, capture and raw validation by distinct commands"
msgstr "通过不同命令完成准备、准入、采集与原始记录验证"

msgid "Physical cases never executed"
msgstr "从未执行的物理用例"

msgid "`tools/evidence/`"
msgstr "`tools/evidence/`"

msgid "Bind executed scope, environment and actual artifact bytes"
msgstr "绑定执行范围、环境和实际产物字节"

msgid "Product signature or safety certification"
msgstr "产品签名或安全认证"

msgid ""
"Use [the SDK tutorial](../../tutorials/source-sdk.md), [assembly "
"reference](assembly.md), [TDD workflow](../../development/workflow.md) and "
"[performance/HIL guide](../../guides/performance-hil.md) for complete tasks."
" Detailed flags come from each maintained CLI `--help`; do not maintain a "
"second parser specification here."
msgstr ""
"完整任务见[SDK 教程](../../tutorials/source-sdk.md)、[装配参考](assembly.md)、[TDD "
"工作流](../../development/workflow.md)和[性能／HIL 指南](../../guides/performance-"
"hil.md)。详细标志由各维护 CLI 的 `--help` 给出，不在此维护第二份解析器规范。"

msgid ""
"Fresh reports require nonzero actual executions and original logs. A missing"
" tool, empty XML, skipped-only run, stale output or changed input cannot "
"satisfy a gate. Do not filter or shard complete acceptance runs. Development"
" subsets retain their limited scope and cannot close a full candidate exit."
msgstr ""
"新报告要求实际执行数量大于零，并保留原始日志。工具缺失、空 "
"XML、只有跳过的运行、陈旧输出或输入变化都不能通过门禁。完整验收执行不得过滤或分片。开发子集保留有限范围，不能关闭完整候选退出条件。"
